@@ -6,7 +6,10 @@ module Batched
     # lands or none of it does. The manifest importer goes through here so
     # that a rejected manifest leaves the book exactly as it was before the
     # attempt.
+    #
+    # requires_new: true so a rejection rolls back only this batch when the
+    # caller (the nightly bulk importer) already has a transaction open.
